<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoEngineCreate</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a new <type>SilikoEngine</type></refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Engine.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoEngine *SilikoEngineCreate(void);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoEngineCreate</function> function creates a new
<type>SilikoEngine</type>. The newly created <type>SilikoEngine</type>
has no functions installed.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoEngineCreate</function> returns a pointer to the
newly created <type>SilikoEngine</type>. The newly created
<type>SilikoEngine</type> must be passed to
<function>SilikoEngineDestroy</function> to avoid a memory leak.
If there is a memory error, <function>SilikoEngineCreate</function>
returns <literal>NULL</literal>.</para>
</refsection>
